 "evidence": "A screening on committed products. Forcings come from the deep column (line-by-line, clear sky, prescribed humidity; all-sky by AR6 ratios on its Earth control), the cloud effects and absorbed sunlight from two ExoPlaSim runs, costs from the domain synthesis, the power screen and the glow study (read only), surface-albedo kernels from the GCM radiation check's clear-sky line-by-line shares with Earth's cloud masking scaled by cover, and the cirrus, methane and albedo responses from published Earth studies. No lever is run in a climate model; each W/m2 is treated as absorbed sunlight at efficacy 1 except the glow, which takes the GCM's 0.71.",
